{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21003","headline":"公无出门 · 李贺","name":"公无出门","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"天迷迷，地密密。\n熊虺食人魂，雪霜断人骨。\n嗾犬狺狺相索索，舐掌偏宜佩兰客。\n帝遣乘轩灾自息，玉星点劒黄金轭。\n我虽跨马不得还，历阳湖波大如山。\n毒虬相视振金环，狻猊猰貐吐嚵涎。\n鲍焦一世披草眠，颜回廿九鬓毛斑。\n颜回非血衰，鲍焦不违天。\n天畏遭衔啮，所以致之然。\n分明犹惧公不信，公看呵壁书问天。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李贺","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_21003.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21003","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}